	<sys:String x:Key="S.Info.Main">🏠 Main — preset gallery&#x0a;&#x0a;📦 Gallery — shows all your cursor presets.&#x0a;   • Left-click a preset — apply cursors.&#x0a;   • Right-click a preset — menu (edit, delete).&#x0a;   • 🧩 badge — some roles are borrowed from other presets.&#x0a;&#x0a;➕ "Add preset" — create a new preset.&#x0a;   • Drag .cur/.ani files or a folder onto the window.&#x0a;&#x0a;🎨 Grid size — changes gallery cell size.&#x0a;📏 Cursor size — slider + "Apply" changes system cursor size.&#x0a;↩️ "Undo" — revert to previous cursor set.&#x0a;🌙/☀ — toggle dark/light theme.&#x0a;🌐 — change interface language.&#x0a;🔍 −/+ — zoom interface in/out.&#x0a;📄 Click the footer — "About" window.</sys:String>

	<sys:String x:Key="S.Info.Editor">✏️ Preset editor&#x0a;&#x0a;🎯 Each slot — one cursor role (arrow, text, busy, etc.).&#x0a;   • Drag a .cur/.ani file onto a slot — fills that role.&#x0a;   • 🎯 on a slot — set pivot point (click position).&#x0a;   • ✕ on a slot — remove file, reverts to system cursor.&#x0a;   • 🔒 on a slot — lock role (protect from folder import and drag-and-drop).&#x0a;   • ⬇ on a slot — download cursor to Downloads folder (named by standard role).&#x0a;   • "Pick from existing" — borrow a role from another preset.&#x0a;   • 🔗 — role is borrowed from another preset (link).&#x0a;   • "auto" badge — cursor is auto-filled.&#x0a;&#x0a;📁 "Choose folder" — import all cursors from a folder at once.&#x0a;   • Files are matched to roles by file name.&#x0a;&#x0a;📝 Enter a preset name at the bottom.&#x0a;⬇ Left of the name — download the whole preset as a folder to Downloads.&#x0a;📏 Size slider — preview cursor size in slots.&#x0a;💾 "Save" — save preset to gallery.</sys:String>

	<sys:String x:Key="S.Info.RolePicker">🔀 Choose role&#x0a;&#x0a;Pick a cursor role from the selected preset.&#x0a;&#x0a;☑️ "Show only the current role" — filter:&#x0a;   • Checked — only the role you're replacing.&#x0a;   • Unchecked — all roles from the preset.&#x0a;&#x0a;Left-click a tile — select role and confirm.&#x0a;Empty tiles — role not assigned in that preset.</sys:String>

	<sys:String x:Key="S.Info.PresetPicker">📂 Choose preset&#x0a;&#x0a;Select a preset to borrow a cursor role from.&#x0a;&#x0a;Left-click a cell — select preset and proceed to role selection.&#x0a;Number at bottom — how many roles are filled in the preset.</sys:String>

	<sys:String x:Key="S.Info.Hotspot">🎯 Pivot point&#x0a;&#x0a;The pivot point is where the cursor's click registers.&#x0a;&#x0a;🖱️ Drag the marker (circle) on the cursor image.&#x0a;   • Or click the desired spot on the preview.&#x0a;&#x0a;⚡ Quick set — 9 buttons with typical positions:&#x0a;   ↖ ↑ ↗   — top row&#x0a;   ← • →   — middle row (• = center)&#x0a;   ↙ ↓ ↘   — bottom row&#x0a;&#x0a;Coordinates shown at bottom-left.&#x0a;💾 "Save" — apply the pivot point.</sys:String>

